Subject: Select native tweak registration with explicit allocation ownership

Upstream-base: 4a9ab8151d9a74e321e52b36c95d1e157d41af60

Size node/value pools for native layouts, own pending registrations before game
memory exists and distinguish borrowed values from registry-owned values. Extract
existing value methods from gameplay units. Bound input/string/path storage and
retain original registration, lookup and value parsing. State push/reset remains
an explicit boundary until its wider pool/recycled-name contract is qualified.

